{"message":"I found the two identical $89.99 CityFit Gym transactions dated 11/06/2025. I’ll dispute the earlier transaction as required for duplicate charges. Before filing, please confirm:

1. Have you contacted CityFit Gym to try to resolve the duplicate charge?
2. May I use your description of this duplicate charge as your written statement for the dispute?"}

{"message":"Thank you. I’ll record your PIN status as “unknown,” and your description can serve as the written statement. I still need two details before filing:

1. Do you still have your physical Green Account debit card?
2. What is your best estimate of when you first noticed the missing $200? If you’re unsure, an approximate date is acceptable (for example, 11/08/2025 or 11/09/2025)."}
